  "bio": "Toni Serrano, hailing from Sabadell, Spain, is a highly experienced tattoo artist revered for his proficient skill in neotraditional and black and gray tattoos. His style beautifully amalgamates a touch of realism with traditional edginess, displaying an inarguably impressive talent. His professionalism is evident through his intricate and meticulous body art, demonstrating a deep understanding and embodiment of his personal philosophy, Ikigai - the intersection of passion and talent turned profession.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Sabadell, Catalonia, Spain"
